  "reasoning": "The defendant, as the legal representative of a company, deliberately evaded paying the wages of 51 employees totaling 378,912 RMB, despite orders from government authorities to pay. He used methods such as escaping and turning off his phone to avoid payment. This conduct constitutes the crime of refusing to pay labor remuneration under Chinese criminal law (拒不支付劳动报酬罪). No other criminal conduct is indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]拒不支付劳动报酬<eoa>"
